3", "author": {"steamid": "76561199226861895", "personaname": "abyss", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199226861895/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 111, "playtime_forever": 611, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 300, "last_played": 1719246508, "avatar": "57be560703e5fea98a960c96f112fe8db7519fdd"}, "language": "english", "review": "good game", "timestamp_created": 1719072710, "timestamp_updated": 1719072710, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "167921113", "author": {"steamid": "76561198328254344", "personaname": "bitster009", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198328254344/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 29, "playtime_forever": 1111, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 26, "playtime_at_review": 387, "last_played": 1791204580, "avatar": "a2c30aa64433d2624393c30f43c424718908829a"}, "language": "english", "review": "sphess mareens atttac!", "timestamp_created": 1719065894, "timestamp_updated": 1719065894, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "167912195", "author": {"steamid": "76561198338094369", "personaname": "Greemlock", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/greemlock_/", "num_games_owned": 1945, "num_reviews": 112, "playtime_forever": 857, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 857, "last_played": 1718439166, "avatar": "b0873e9e7b9243d0724653efd0cf5135e00fb517"}, "language": "english", "review": "[b] This review is for the single player campaign only. [/b]\nA person who doesn't care about Warhammer has a point to play this game, for one reason only — meaty action. The game is a mixture of hack and slash and a third-person shooter.\n\nEverything about the impact in this game is executed perfectly. Weapons are pleasant to use, enemies are actively flying apart and even in movement you can feel the heaviness of the armor that your character is wearing.\n\nHowever, this is where the advantages of the game end. The plot is devoid of interesting characters, and the events are not exciting enough for you to care about them. All the game's locations are monotonous brown corridors.\n\nWhile the gameplay feels enjoyable, it is very monotonous. The only thing the game tries to diversify the gameplay is the stages where you can fly a jetpack around the arena, they are really fun, but there are very few of them. Enemies with a couple of exceptions do not require a special approach in most cases they are just cannon fodder, which you just mindlessly shoot.\n\nThere are a lot of weapons in the game, but you will rarely use anything other than the standard bolter. You will have to resort to melee combat only to restore your health and from the pool of special attacks you will use only stun all other techniques are useless.\n\nThe game can be recommended only if you want a mindless shooter for a couple of evenings, but not for its current full price.", "timestamp_created": 1719058194, "timestamp_updated": 1719058194, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}]}